# CEO's OS — Security Boundary Adapter

Apply `AGENTS.md` and `docs/security/SECURITY_REVIEW_CHECKLIST.md` when a matching security boundary is in scope.

Verify as applicable:

- authentication and permission checks occur server-side;
- organization ownership is derived from authenticated server context;
- object lookup binds tenant, entity and physical storage identity;
- negative role and cross-tenant cases fail safely;
- validation occurs before persistence or privileged transitions;
- audit records preserve sanitized actor, organization, action and time;
- errors and logs expose no secrets, tokens or private data;
- test DB/VDR roots are isolated from canonical runtime data.

Frontend visibility is never authorization. Passing happy-path tests does not close a security finding.
